import{t as e}from"./buildPage-DWQZYYcs.js";var t=e({slug:`investment-memo`,heroTitle:`Build your investment memo in minutes`,heroSubtitle:`Perplexity Computer researches the company, analyzes financials, and delivers a structured investment memo - automatically.`,inputUrlCta:`Build my memo`,inputUrlPlaceholder:`company website or ticker`,inputUrlPrefill:`Go to {url} and build a comprehensive investment memo for this company. 1) Extract the company's business model, products, target market, and competitive positioning from the site. 2) Research the company's latest financials - revenue, margins, growth rates, funding rounds, and valuation data from public sources, SEC filings, and news. 3) Analyze the competitive landscape - identify top 5 competitors, market share estimates, and key differentiators. 4) Assess the total addressable market (TAM), serviceable addressable market (SAM), and growth trajectory with supporting data. 5) Identify key risks - regulatory, competitive, execution, and financial risks with severity ratings. 6) Build a bull case and bear case with specific catalysts and price/valuation implications. 7) Deliver a structured investment memo with: executive summary, business overview, financial analysis, competitive landscape, market opportunity, risk assessment, bull/bear cases, and a final investment recommendation with conviction level.`,heroOverlaySteps:[`Researching the company's business model, products, and positioning`,`Pulling financials, growth metrics, and valuation data from public sources`,`Analyzing competitive landscape, market size, and key risks`,`Structured investment memo with bull/bear cases - ready to review`],generatingSteps:[`Visiting {url} to extract business model, products, and market positioning`,`Designing an agent to research financials, competitors, and market data`,`Configuring risk assessment, bull/bear case analysis, and TAM modeling`,`Setting up your structured investment memo with recommendation and conviction level`],featureSectionTitle:`From company to investment memo`,featureCardTitles:[`Connects to your investing stack`,`Outputs you can act on`],featureCardDescriptions:[`Computer breaks your project into tasks, spins up specialized agents, and matches each one to the AI model that does it best.`,`Google Sheets, Notion, Google Drive, Airtable, Microsoft Power BI - Computer plugs into your tools so research, models, and memos flow into one workflow.`,`Executive summary. Financial analysis with key metrics. Competitive landscape map. TAM/SAM sizing. Risk matrix. Bull/bear cases with catalysts. Final recommendation with conviction level.`],capabilitySectionTitle:`Your research analyst, on autopilot`,capabilitySectionSubtitle:`Paste a company URL, step away, come back to a complete investment memo.`,capabilityCards:[{title:`Company Deep Dive`,description:`Computer can research a company's business model, revenue streams, unit economics, and competitive positioning - pulling from the website, filings, and public sources.`},{title:`Financial Analysis`,description:`Computer can extract and analyze revenue, margins, growth rates, burn rate, and valuation multiples - and benchmark them against comparable companies.`},{title:`Bull & Bear Cases`,description:`Computer can build scenario analyses with specific catalysts, probability weightings, and valuation implications for upside and downside cases.`},{title:`Connect Your Tools`,description:`Computer can read from Google Sheets, Notion, Google Drive, Airtable, and more - build workflows across your entire research and portfolio stack.`},{title:`Thesis Tracking`,description:`Computer can remember your investment criteria, past memos, and portfolio context - so every new analysis builds on your existing framework.`},{title:`Monitor & Alert`,description:`Computer can track earnings releases, competitor moves, and market shifts - and flag when key assumptions in your memo need updating.`}]});export{t as default};
